  <purpose>🔴 mock_run_container (Flask :8796) / go_run_container (Go :8796) 本机 Docker 模拟运行器删除；🔴 taskContainerGateway mock-run-container 代理面 (start/stop/status/env-defaults) 删除；🔴 taskCloudService /api/internal/mock-run/* (env-defaults / resolve-image) 删除；🔴 taskFE「模拟启动」面板删除；🟡 comment_csc_bootstrap mock/空平台分支改为报错拦截；容器启动统一走云端机器 (start-vm → CLOUD_SERVER_STARTED → ECS)</purpose>

